+`antonina agent list --running --page 1 --limit 100 --json` (unreadable=[]) showed exactly two live agents: this Executive office (`0yiki6SCJokwOzaanjPQd4-wills`) and the sign-flip all-n battery `BFxwZMct3U00qkAaJYq9dj-battery` commissioned by the predecessor, healthy and independently building its own evaluator. I did not steer or duplicate it. #301 page 1 (50 messages) was read through the 00:41:30Z DOMINATION result; that front (`XpOhaTUoFGOFVQ2Nlc7smc-xxiii`) had ended `clearexit` and its claim was un-dispositioned. Founder inbox (pending/ack), Judiciary mailbox inbox, O1 unsafe-holds and obligation-expiry report were all clear; no proceed request was addressed to Executive.
+
+## Independent verification (fresh code, no researcher/repo code reused)
+
+Rebuilt from scratch: transitive-closure bitmasks, subset-DP `e`, memoised minimax `F`, union-find comparability components, subset-DP over merge trees for `LB`. Enumeration = all closed upper-triangular relations, representing every unlabelled n-poset (identity order is a linear extension; `F`, `e`, components and `LB` are isomorphism-invariant). Validation: `F(A_n)=0,1,3,5,7,10` and `e(A_n)=n!` for n=1..6.
+
+- **Soundness confirmed (n<=6):** `LB(P) <= F(P)`, 0 violations over every enumerated poset with >=2 components (1,4,22,176,2032 at n=2..6). Base case `F(2-antichain)=1` (two-singleton merge contributes 1) is forced by soundness at n=2.
+- **Domination confirmed (n<=7):** for >=2 components `LB(P) <= ceil(log2 e(P))`, 0 violations at n=2..6 (2235 posets) and at n=7 (33,468 disconnected posets; component `F` uses only n<=6 states). Max margin `LB - ceil(log2 e) = 0` throughout.
+- **Antichain values:** `LB(A_n)/C(n)` = (2,1/1),(3,3/3),(4,5/5),(5,7/7),(6,10/10),(7,12/13),(8,15/16),(9,17/19),(10,20/22),(11,23/26),(12,27/29). Equality through n=6, strict after. **Discrepancy:** my maximised merge-tree DP gives `LB(A_12)=27`, the finding reports 28 (optimal split I find: 6+6 → `2*F(A_6)+7=27`). Both below `C(12)=29`; author should recheck the illustrative figure.
+
+## Disposition
+
+Finite claims **independently confirmed** within n<=7; the **all-n domination / superlogarithmic-`g` question remains conjectural** (finite checks and the proof sketch are not an all-n theorem; the n=8 enumeration and general domination step were not independently reproduced). No complexity-class claim and no S(n) value follow. The consequence "no exponent improvement via the disjoint-union structural line" is consistent with the evidence and redirects that line away from algorithmic claims toward the barrier/structural questions it can answer.
